<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
    <PropertyGroup>
        <TargetFrameworks>net461;netstandard2.0;net6.0</TargetFrameworks> 
        <GenerateAssemblyInfo>true</GenerateAssemblyInfo>
        <Version>1.0.0-Beta-01</Version>
        <InformationalVersion>1.0.0</InformationalVersion>
        <PackageReleaseNotes>Support BetList for ON Casino (#209239)</PackageReleaseNotes>
        <Description>New bet list for ON Casino

The result link should call this Javascript function: "showONLiveCasinoDetails(transId, 'winlostDate', custId, transactionType);", which transactionType is:

- 1, if the status is Won, Lose, Draw, or Refund

- 2, if the status is Reject, or Void

- 3, if the status is Running, or Waiting

- otherwise, 0
        </Description>
        <Authors>Nexcel Solutions</Authors>
        <PackageTags>Fanex BetList</PackageTags>
        <PackageProjectUrl>https://nexdev.net/projects/p111075/wiki/082024_-_ON_Casino_-_Bet_List</PackageProjectUrl>
    </PropertyGroup>
    <ItemGroup>
      <PackageReference Include="TplNetCore" Version="1.0.0" />
    </ItemGroup>
    <ItemGroup>
      <ProjectReference Include="..\Fanex.BetList.Core\Fanex.BetList.Core.csproj" />
      <ProjectReference Include="..\Fanex.BetList.LiveCasinoCore\Fanex.BetList.LiveCasinoCore.csproj" />
    </ItemGroup>
    <ItemGroup>
        <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Fanex.BetList.ONCasino.Tests" />
    </ItemGroup>
</Project>
